{
    "title": "Fruitsies - Pet Friends",
    "description": "Discover a virtual Fruitsies world, where dreamy fields and blooming flowers surround a charming fruit house full of adorable pets and their animal friends. Explore their virtual world, hatch eggs, and play exciting virtual pet games together! \r\n\r\n<b>HATCH & TAKE CARE OF FRUIT BABIES</b>\r\nHatch colorful eggs to meet various animal friends \u2013 each virtual pet has its unique personality! Shower Fruitsies with love and attention: nourish your animal friends with baby milk and delicious food! Watch every virtual pet fruit grow and get ready to play exciting animal games!\r\n\r\n<b>COLLECT ALL ANIMAL PETS</b>\r\nMeet loads of unique virtual animal friends \u2013 from Watermelon Cat to Banana Horse and Raspberry Sheep \u2013 you can hatch them all, so get ready for pet games! Want to collect every virtual pet fruit? Play animal games to gather coins, hatch eggs, or merge Fruitsies in the eggs-merging machine!\r\n\r\n<b>PLAY MINI PET GAMES</b>\r\nEvery virtual pet fruit wants to play fun animal games! Jump to collect coins, enter the virtual portal, play basketball and other pet games! Feeling artsy? Unleash your creativity by drawing, experimenting with makeup, and dressing your virtual pet fruit in the cutest outfits. \r\n\r\n<b>DISCOVER FUN ACTIVITIES & PLAY</b>\r\nVirtual Fruitsies house is full of animal friends and exciting activities, so stay curious and explore! Every virtual pet fruit will be happy to bounce on a delightful trampoline flower, explore a unique tunnel castle, play in a colorful ball pit, and engage in many more pet games! \r\n\r\nReady to discover the virtual world of Fruitsies and meet your new animal friends? Download now, hatch eggs & play animal games! \r\n\r\n- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -\r\n\r\nAbout TutoTOONS Games for Kids\r\nCrafted and play-tested with kids and toddlers, TutoTOONS games foster kids\u2019 creativity and help them learn while playing the games they love. Fun and educational TutoTOONS games strive to bring meaningful and safe mobile experience to millions of children worldwide.\r\n\r\nImportant Message to Parents\r\nThis app is free to download and play, but there may be certain in-game items that can be purchased for real money. By downloading this app you agree to TutoTOONS Privacy Policy and Terms of Use https://tutotoons.com/terms.\r\n\r\nDiscover More Fun with TutoTOONS!\r\n\u00b7 Subscribe to our YouTube channel: https://www.youtube.com/@TutoTOONS\r\n\u00b7 Learn more about us: https://tutotoons.com\r\n\u00b7 Read our blog: https://blog.tutotoons.com\r\n\u00b7 Like us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/tutotoons\r\n\u00b7 Follow us on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/tutotoons/",
    "descriptionHTML": "Discover a virtual Fruitsies world, where dreamy fields and blooming flowers surround a charming fruit house full of adorable pets and their animal friends. Explore their virtual world, hatch eggs, and play exciting virtual pet games together! <br><br><b>HATCH &amp; TAKE CARE OF FRUIT BABIES</b><br>Hatch colorful eggs to meet various animal friends \u2013 each virtual pet has its unique personality! Shower Fruitsies with love and attention: nourish your animal friends with baby milk and delicious food! Watch every virtual pet fruit grow and get ready to play exciting animal games!<br><br><b>COLLECT ALL ANIMAL PETS</b><br>Meet loads of unique virtual animal friends \u2013 from Watermelon Cat to Banana Horse and Raspberry Sheep \u2013 you can hatch them all, so get ready for pet games! Want to collect every virtual pet fruit? Play animal games to gather coins, hatch eggs, or merge Fruitsies in the eggs-merging machine!<br><br><b>PLAY MINI PET GAMES</b><br>Every virtual pet fruit wants to play fun animal games! Jump to collect coins, enter the virtual portal, play basketball and other pet games! Feeling artsy? Unleash your creativity by drawing, experimenting with makeup, and dressing your virtual pet fruit in the cutest outfits. <br><br><b>DISCOVER FUN ACTIVITIES &amp; PLAY</b><br>Virtual Fruitsies house is full of animal friends and exciting activities, so stay curious and explore! Every virtual pet fruit will be happy to bounce on a delightful trampoline flower, explore a unique tunnel castle, play in a colorful ball pit, and engage in many more pet games! <br><br>Ready to discover the virtual world of Fruitsies and meet your new animal friends? Download now, hatch eggs &amp; play animal games! <br><br>- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -<br><br>About TutoTOONS Games for Kids<br>Crafted and play-tested with kids and toddlers, TutoTOONS games foster kids\u2019 creativity and help them learn while playing the games they love. Fun and educational TutoTOONS games strive to bring meaningful and safe mobile experience to millions of children worldwide.<br><br>Important Message to Parents<br>This app is free to download and play, but there may be certain in-game items that can be purchased for real money. By downloading this app you agree to TutoTOONS Privacy Policy and Terms of Use https://tutotoons.com/terms.<br><br>Discover More Fun with TutoTOONS!<br>\u00b7 Subscribe to our YouTube channel: https://www.youtube.com/@TutoTOONS<br>\u00b7 Learn more about us: https://tutotoons.com<br>\u00b7 Read our blog: https://blog.tutotoons.com<br>\u00b7 Like us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/tutotoons<br>\u00b7 Follow us on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/tutotoons/",
